      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy a template…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以此为上一场，准备下一场": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prepare the next meeting from this one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中提词": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live answers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中自动给出回答 · 回答简短 · 会后复盘并存进题库": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers appear automatically · Brief answers · Review afterwards, saved to the question bank"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中自动给出回答 · 回答简短 · 纪要：需求、顾虑、我们答应的、下一步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers appear automatically · Brief answers · Notes: needs, concerns, what we promised, next steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中自动给出回答，跟着讲稿 · 回答简短 · 纪要：听众问了什么、怎么答更好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers appear automatically, follows your slides · Brief answers · Notes: what the audience asked and better answers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会删除所有会议的转写、问题、提词和纪要，无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes every meeting's transcript, questions, answers and notes. It can't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会后整理纪要不赶时间，追求准确和详细，所以用单独的模型：默认是能用到的最强模型，推理强度“高”，不开快速模式。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are not in a hurry; they need to be accurate and detailed, so they use their own model: by default the strongest available, reasoning “high”, no fast mode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeting %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议 %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meetings %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议中顶栏的“提词 / 只记录”决定是否自动回答，默认值由会议类型决定（面试、汇报、客户沟通默认提词）。提词时，以问号或“吗 / 呢”结尾的问题约 0.6 秒内开始回答；拿不准的句子显示为可点击的“可能的问题”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Prompt / Notes only switch in the meeting's top bar decides whether answers appear automatically; the meeting type sets the default (interviews, presentations and client calls start in Prompt). In Prompt, questions are answered within about 0.6 seconds; unclear sentences show up as clickable “possible questions”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议结束后自动整理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write notes when a meeting ends"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议结束后自动整理纪要（设置 → 纪要）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write notes when a meeting ends (Settings → Notes)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
